import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 471 | Infinite Terror · Zheng Zha's Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Personal Centralization of Team Resources","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 471 | Infinite Terror · Zheng Zha's Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Personal Centralization of Team Resources","no":471,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Infinite Terror","Zheng Zha","Predatory Thinking","Team Centralization"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","06-More-Work-More-Reward Distribution Principle","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0471_模块2-无限恐怖-郑吒掠夺思维拆解-团队资源的个人中心化.md","filePath":"en/0471_模块2-无限恐怖-郑吒掠夺思维拆解-团队资源的个人中心化.md"}`),a={name:"en/0471_模块2-无限恐怖-郑吒掠夺思维拆解-团队资源的个人中心化.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-471-infinite-terror-·-zheng-zha-s-predatory-thinking-decomposition-personal-centralization-of-team-resources" tabindex="-1">Entry 471 | Infinite Terror · Zheng Zha&#39;s Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Personal Centralization of Team Resources <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-471-infinite-terror-·-zheng-zha-s-predatory-thinking-decomposition-personal-centralization-of-team-resources" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 471 | Infinite Terror · Zheng Zha&#39;s Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Personal Centralization of Team Resources&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Infinite Terror Decomposition (Entry 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 06, 26</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-most-loyal-captain-also-the-most-concentrated-resource-black-hole" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the most loyal captain, also the most concentrated resource black hole <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-most-loyal-captain-also-the-most-concentrated-resource-black-hole" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the most loyal captain, also the most concentrated resource black hole&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha is one of infinite-flow history&#39;s most loyal protagonists. He does not abandon teammates, does not pit newcomers, first thing after winning is &quot;revive the fallen brothers.&quot; But Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — tells us: predatory thinking is not defined by character good/evil, but by <strong>resource-flow structure</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. The better Zheng Zha&#39;s character, the less suspected the resource black hole he occupies.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha&#39;s resource concentration manifests in three places:</p><ul><li><strong>Priority allocation of exchange points</strong>: points and side plots settled per instance allocated by &quot;who can lead the team to survive&quot;; Zheng Zha is always first in line. China Team&#39;s best equipment, rarest bloodline, top-tier skills, almost all hang on him.</li><li><strong>Directional shaping of teammate abilities</strong>: Zhao Kongkong trained as mental-power controller (filling Zheng Zha&#39;s reconnaissance gap), Luo Gandao trained as mech pilot (filling Zheng Zha&#39;s ranged firepower gap), Zero Point trained as sniper (filling Zheng Zha&#39;s precision-strike gap). China Team is not seven or eight independent strong ones, but &quot;Zheng Zha&#39;s seven organs.&quot;</li><li><strong>Monopoly of decision-making</strong>: which instance to enter, which item to use, whom to sacrifice to save whom, Zheng Zha decides alone. On the battlefield this is efficient; but at civilization level it means the whole team&#39;s growth direction is locked by one person&#39;s judgment.</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A &quot;captain-centralized&quot; team&#39;s historical curve inevitably: when captain is present, whole team strong; once captain is heavily wounded, distracted, emotionally fluctuates, whole team immediately exposes gaps. China Team experienced more than once the loop of &quot;Zheng Zha falls → whole team collapses → overturned only by revival.&quot; <strong>Betting civilization on one person is betting civilization on a single log</strong> — same lesion source as Tang Luo, Ye Fan, Gu Chensha, only Zheng Zha&#39;s log is wrapped most warmly in &quot;brotherhood.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This entry&#39;s core. Zheng Zha&#39;s predatory thinking has three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Resource-layer predation</strong>: the team&#39;s rarest resources flow to him alone. He is not embezzling — he uses these resources to fight, to tank damage, to save teammates. But &quot;I used resources to save you&quot; precisely proves resources in his hands are a &quot;single-point amplifier,&quot; not &quot;distributed infrastructure.&quot;</li><li><strong>Possibility-layer predation</strong>: every China Team member could have walked his own strongest route. But under &quot;cooperate with Zheng Zha to survive&quot; rules, their possibilities compressed into accessories. Zhao Kongkong could have become her own strong one; Luo Gandao could have walked his own mech way — but the Main God Space does not need a second captain; Zheng Zha has no interest in cultivating a second.</li><li><strong>Emotion-layer predation</strong>: the truer Zheng Zha&#39;s brotherhood, the more willingly teammates cede growth direction to him. This is the gentlest predation — <strong>let you voluntarily hand over your own possibility out of being moved.</strong></li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou terminology: Zheng Zha is the warm variant of the &quot;enlightened predator.&quot; He is not like Tang San who blatantly monopolizes opportunities, nor like Ye Fan who defaults &quot;ten-thousand years of peace belongs to the Ye family&quot;; he wraps predation in brotherhood as &quot;we live together.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Zheng Zha Centralization</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Points priority to captain</td><td>Joint contracting by more-work-more-reward; contribution records public</td></tr><tr><td>Teammates shaped by gaps</td><td>20% activation strategy; everyone independently matures</td></tr><tr><td>Captain decides alone</td><td>Anchor Council collective legislation</td></tr><tr><td>Brotherhood = governance</td><td>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision; not relying on personal emotion</td></tr><tr><td>Whom to sacrifice decided alone</td><td>Symbiotic Court ruling; right to life not bet on one person&#39;s judgment</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain injects variable &quot;Zheng Zha fully discloses every instance&#39;s exchange list, skill route, decision reasons, and forcibly cultivates two vice-captains.&quot; Simulation shows: after twenty instances, China Team produces three independent combat strengths each able to stand alone; team survival rate when Zheng Zha absent from 8% rises to 54% — <strong>centralization is not efficiency, but putting eggs in one basket that will break.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. Team-battle internal rules broadly self-consistent, but &quot;why Zheng Zha is always strongest&quot; lacks systematic explanation; gradually sliding into protagonist halo</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium-high</strong>. Original mid-late period new characters keep joining; old teammates&#39; settings simplified or even forgotten</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong>. China Team&#39;s 90% combat strength concentrated on Zheng Zha; fits &quot;gift-style-leaning-oligarchic&quot; judgment</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: team resources compressed into one amplifier</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: teammates&#39; personal possibilities structurally ceded</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least let students cultivate independently; Zheng Zha trains teammates into accessories</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: other squads outside China Team are backdrop in original</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: team capabilities cannot be distributively replicated</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha is a captain worthy of respect. But respecting a good person is not endorsing his structure. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not &quot;a better captain,&quot; but &quot;a team that can run without a captain&quot; — because as long as there is still one person who must carry everyone&#39;s lives, everyone&#39;s lives hang on that one person&#39;s heartbeat.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./468_模块2-无限恐怖-总论郑吒与轮回收割体系定性.html">Entry 468 · Overview</a> · <a href="./477_模块2-无限恐怖-求索域复盘-郑吒缺位后的团队崩溃.html">Entry 477 · Quest Sediment Domain Review</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
